@* The visitor's colour theme: three buttons, wired by wwwroot/theme.js (docs/theme.md). Presentational only: the script does the work, so the page works without it, showing three buttons that change nothing. Styling comes from the app's own CSS tokens (the .wc-theme-* rules in docs/theme.md). *@
<div class="wc-theme" role="group" aria-label="Colour theme">
    <button type="button" class="wc-theme-button" data-theme-choice="system" aria-pressed="false">System</button>
    <button type="button" class="wc-theme-button" data-theme-choice="light" aria-pressed="false">Light</button>
    <button type="button" class="wc-theme-button" data-theme-choice="dark" aria-pressed="false">Dark</button>
</div>
